{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年44歲的梁芷珮（Christy）與老公Kenneth結婚多年，育有兩子一女，一家五口幸福美滿。梁芷珮同老公夫妻檔拍住上成為旅遊KOL，經常孖住周遊列國為大家介紹好去處，近年更憑主持TVB旅遊節目《潮什麼》系列而大受歡迎，實行寓工作於娛樂！年輕誕子的梁芷珮，平日與三名子女相處融洽如朋友，毫無代溝，但日前她卻被二仔的一句Gen Z（Z世代）網絡潮語徹底難倒！</p><figure><img alt=\"梁芷珮（Christy）與老公Kenneth結婚多年。（IG@imchristyleung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189285556950405120163542.jpeg/QtZp-8DYSEEXkOGFY2pQ_fpxUN2rjqP7MnXDzzJ1w88\"/><figcaption>梁芷珮（Christy）與老公Kenneth結婚多年。（IG@imchristyleung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"溫馨。（IG@imchristyleung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250708/1019294249562279936914326.jpeg/sfE71HyNC08XQ_q63rQa8UG5fUZT5D1j5kr18uZK9fI\"/><figcaption>溫馨。（IG@imchristyleung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"經常周遊列國。（IG@imchristyleung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189285544614432768506247.jpeg/N0RktRjkMnoxvNp3JdrgipZCAaLgfmHSQG3_J0Bt_yc\"/><figcaption>經常周遊列國。（IG@imchristyleung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"育有兩子一女。（IG@imchristyleung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250529/1004774558315712512354827.jpeg/PLUfqRz5DMwWU_G5O_HXKtlHi0xk4eCFH1SFTB9UhUw\"/><figcaption>育有兩子一女。（IG@imchristyleung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"溫馨。（IG@imchristyleung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250708/1019294249562279936914326.jpeg/sfE71HyNC08XQ_q63rQa8UG5fUZT5D1j5kr18uZK9fI\"/><figcaption>溫馨。（IG@imchristyleung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大仔Brendan已經22歲。（IG@imchristyleung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189285661245444096947658.png/vE3fRW-4MUiiBiy1ZLJGu8suJh0CBhb5-C2rDPgtqww\"/><figcaption>大仔Brendan已經22歲。（IG@imchristyleung）</figcaption></figure><p>梁芷珮家庭群組對話曝光　二仔Gen Z縮寫「Wdym」引發無限Loop</p><p>梁芷珮日前於社交平台分享一段家庭群組「Lai's Family」的對話截圖，對話中，梁芷珮先問二仔Duncan「How about the way u run?」，二仔Duncan隨即簡短回覆：「Wydm（Wdym）」，不明所以的梁芷珮追問道：「What's Wydm mean（Wydm是什麼意思）」，二仔見狀即解釋：「What u mean（你是指什麼意思）」。怎料梁芷珮未能悟出對方的意思，以為二仔在反問她，於是再問一次「What is this mean」，Duncan再解釋：「What do u mean（你是指什麼意思）」，但梁芷珮依然不明白，兩母子互相反問，對話相當搞笑！</p><figure><img alt=\"二仔一句「Wdym」引發無限Loop。（IG@imchristyleung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189285290095808512106583.jpeg/GlyCDubN5ygTtsG162MgPbkyVkdtsLceKauPXSmrj10\"/><figcaption>二仔一句「Wdym」引發無限Loop。（IG@imchristyleung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"二仔一句「Wdym」引發無限Loop。（IG@imchristyleung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189285287633620992413607.png/Eq3kZgb3ebAfhHzfpOtv9HV1z1XWx4IVNdZ31TXWd9U\"/><figcaption>二仔一句「Wdym」引發無限Loop。（IG@imchristyleung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"二仔Duncan 15歲生日。（IG@imchristyleung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189291799915532288523016.jpeg/2UtJEVhtwOYprWGsyWwznf2q_hsHv_5bHVcwmh1XMJo\"/><figcaption>二仔Duncan 15歲生日。（IG@imchristyleung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁芷珮為大仔Brendan慶祝22歲生日！（IG@imchristyleung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260630/1148695975242633216750346.jpeg/m4G9pqtXzulL-1WPNCHo7mtOxOY_CyQathIwg7YSMIM\"/><figcaption>梁芷珮為大仔Brendan慶祝22歲生日！（IG@imchristyleung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一家五口幸福美滿！（IG@imchristyleung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250108/953664172845961216753984.jpeg/TXKoN0HQUI9w3xJppOVVH64HP1VaAhDhNJ9aszSfWrM\"/><figcaption>一家五口幸福美滿！（IG@imchristyleung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"二仔陪媽媽跑步！（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260630/1148696997885382656592106.jpeg/1XdYkqJkK7RvgSwyi_-0PYZGYWIQhIHMFpM-WBaTPlg\"/><figcaption>二仔陪媽媽跑步！（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"囡囡愈大愈靚女。（IG@imchristyleung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189285545700757504624987.jpeg/dtDYvvyyVXEr7_Y41CHO7NPLrRyiEjswqKPYT6ij2E8\"/><figcaption>囡囡愈大愈靚女。（IG@imchristyleung）</figcaption></figure><p>梁芷珮無奈感嘆：Gen Z language真係好難明呀</p><p>梁芷珮坦言完全沒意識到二仔所講的正是「What do you mean」的英文首字母縮寫，她無奈地寫道：「係咪淨係我唔知咩叫wdym?Gen Z language真係好難明呀，我同佢無限loop咗10次，老公先話我知係what do u mean🫣」不少網民及家長看後紛紛留言笑指十分有共鳴：「gen Z仲有好同字我地唔明㗎」、「媽媽要學嘢喇」。</p><figure><img alt=\"大仔Brendan大學畢業。（IG@imchristyleung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260725/1157711259135643648064378.jpeg/cH_QuScrPG9w2g8SQTG3CYLS1NpzroRpubM6krmzOpI\"/><figcaption>大仔Brendan大學畢業。（IG@imchristyleung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一家人去旅行。（IG@imchristyleung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189285554232365056167394.jpeg/Z33dZ00nrE5bENQWEBSEZWZyHka87At3gFpVvoBaVb4\"/><figcaption>一家人去旅行。（IG@imchristyleung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一家人去旅行。（IG@imchristyleung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189285551162003456904186.jpeg/8-5UwOxXf8LVGY_fY_NBDe3tWHINoFdz3fqWFt36lhY\"/><figcaption>一家人去旅行。（IG@imchristyleung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一家人去旅行。（IG@imchristyleung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189285548766924800785341.jpeg/MCcQX7Aiun7WkPVQl8PXQSwK7LmLs9GNADwi0gA8ItI\"/><figcaption>一家人去旅行。（IG@imchristyleung）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:24:38.329120+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1237,"images":17,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T13:00:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T14:18:27.438755+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T13:18:35.380720+00:00","content_hash":"3af785cc7cea63c3caae16529e7858ce35d4af822aef971f01a55daa93a3d237","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}